Presetted values:
lim{x->\inf, (ln(x))^300/x} = [t=ln(x)] = lim{t->\inf, t^300/e^t}
lim{x->\inf, ln(sqrt(x))/x} = [t=sqrt(x)] = lim{t->\inf, ln(x)/x^2}
lim{x->\inf, 2^ln(x)/x^ln(2)} = [t=ln(x)] = lim{t->\inf, 2^t/(e^t)^ln(2)}

(A=x^2, B=x), (A=2+x, B=x)
lim{x->\inf, ln(2^x)/ln(3^x)} = lim{x->\inf, x*ln(2)/(x*ln(3))}
lim{x->\inf, (ln(x)+ln(2x))/ln(x^2)}

Basic relationship:
Vertical/Vertikal: lim{x->0, f(x)}=\m\inf
Horizontal/Horizontell: lim{x->\inf, f(x)}=m
Oblique/Sneda: y=kx+m k=lim{x->\inf, f(x)/x}, m=lim{x->\inf, f(x)-kx}
